### 400 — Empty body (neither branding, layout, seo, audienceMode, nor questions provided)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/hotsite
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 400 — audienceMode/questions embedded inside a LEAD_FORM module's own layout[].data, instead
### of as top-level fields (GenericErrorCode.VALUE_INVALID — see packages/validation/src/hotsite.ts's
### HotsiteModuleSchema refine; audienceMode/questions must never reach the public-cached manifest)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tenants/hotsite
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-Actor-ID: {{managerId}}
X-Actor-Type: STAFF
X-Actor-Role: MANAGER
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "layout": [
    {
      "type": "LEAD_FORM",
      "enabled": true,
      "data": { "title": "Fale com a gente", "ctaLabel": "Preencher", "audienceMode": "CUSTOMER_ONLY" }
    }
  ]
}

